{
	"version": 1,
	"note": "3-layer market taxonomy. Layer 1 (macro) and Layer 2 (micro) are CLOSED enums; a market resolves to 1..N macros with exactly one PRIMARY. Layer 3 (tags) is OPEN and OPTIONAL. Every micro belongs to exactly one macro, so macro is derived from micro — never stored. Runtime source of truth is src/lib/constants/market-taxonomy.constants.ts; this JSON mirrors it for review and is the design artifact for the deck-validation work in Spec B. The UI renders only macros/micros whose market_tag_index bucket is non-empty.",
